Package: ar0234-camera
Version: 0.1.0
Architecture: arm64
Maintainer: zyi <2971385581@qq.com>
Depends: linux-image-current-sun60iw2 (= 1.0.0), linux-dtb-current-sun60iw2 (= 1.0.0)
Section: kernel
Priority: optional
Description: AR0234 global-shutter camera support for Orange Pi Zero 3W (A733)
 Sensor driver and vin framework modules (ISP 3DNR in LBC mode), libisp 3A
 daemon (ar0234-3ad), VE hardware recorder (ar0234-rec), device tree update
 via fdtput, and first-pass ISP tuning parameters.
 Built against linux-image-current-sun60iw2 1.0.0 (kernel 6.6.98-sun60iw2);
 external kernel modules are version-sensitive, hence the exact Depends.
